  "_comment": "Out of the quarry pit and up the haul road round the terraces, a banked ledge with no rail on the drop side, a glide off the rim down to the shelf, then the corkscrew: a turn and a half of 60 degree grip road screwing down into the pit, no wall on the low side, the karts stuck to it and gaining speed all the way, out into the pit floor and the run home. The detonator on the ledge opens the blast tunnel through the mesa, cutting the rim and the glide, a scree chute on the corkscrew's second turn is a dash strip from lap 2, and rockfall litters the pit floor from the last lap.",
